    <briefdescription>
<para>A partition of the slices. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>An ephemeral representation for a range of slices which can be viewed as a partition of the alloca. This range represents a span of the alloca&apos;s memory which cannot be split, and provides access to all of the slices overlapping some part of the partition.</para>
<para>Objects of this type are produced by traversing the alloca&apos;s slices, but are only ephemeral and not persistent. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
